  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIHR satellite sessions at the Global Symposium on Health Systems Research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) Raise the profile of NIHR in the global health research funding landscape. 2) Bring together researchers and thought-leaders to inform the development of the GHR team&#x2019;s future activities in global Health Policy and Systems Research. 3) Provide support to the participation of low- and middle-income country (LMIC)-based speakers in the Symposium.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To inform the development of a dedicated NIHR-led Health Policy and Systems Research (HPSR) programme and the co-creation of strategic partnerships addressing global HPSR, NIHR undertakes outreach and consultation activities to establish areas where there is an unmet need or skill shortage, and areas which are under-funded or under-researched. The 5th, 6th, 7th, and 8th Global HSR Symposia presented unique opportunities for NIHR to engage in an international event and consult stakeholders through the organisation of dedicated satellite sessions.</narrative>
  </description>
